          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>A queue is FIFO, so &#39;*&#39; prints the OLDEST enqueued character still waiting. Enqueue H,o,w,A,r,e → [H,o,w,A,r,e]; &#39;*&#39; dequeue+print H; &#39;*&#39; print o; &#39;*&#39; print w → &quot;How&quot;; enqueue Y,o,u → [A,r,e,Y,o,u]; &#39;*&#39; print A; &#39;*&#39; print r → &quot;HowAr&quot;; enqueue T,o → [e,Y,o,u,T,o]; &#39;*&#39; print e; &#39;*&#39; print Y; &#39;*&#39; print o → &quot;HowAreYo&quot;; enqueue D,a,y — input ends, nothing more printed. Final output: &quot;HowAreYo&quot;.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Hàng đợi hoạt động theo FIFO, nên mỗi lần gặp &#39;*&#39; sẽ in ra ký tự CŨ NHẤT còn đang chờ. Enqueue H,o,w,A,r,e → [H,o,w,A,r,e]; &#39;*&#39; dequeue+in H; &#39;*&#39; in o; &#39;*&#39; in w → &quot;How&quot;; enqueue Y,o,u → [A,r,e,Y,o,u]; &#39;*&#39; in A; &#39;*&#39; in r → &quot;HowAr&quot;; enqueue T,o → [e,Y,o,u,T,o]; &#39;*&#39; in e; &#39;*&#39; in Y; &#39;*&#39; in o → &quot;HowAreYo&quot;; enqueue D,a,y — hết đầu vào, không in thêm gì. Kết quả cuối: &quot;HowAreYo&quot;.</p></div>"
