              "text": "In a binary search tree, all the nodes that are left descendants of node A have key values greater than A; all the nodes that are A&#39;s right descendants have key values less than (or equal to) A.|||In a binary search tree, all the nodes that are left descendants of node A have key values greater than A; all the nodes that are A&#39;s right descendants have key values less than (or equal to) A."
